{"seq":1,"slug":"lora","title":"LoRA 原理与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/lora","wordCount":780,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"lora-原理与实践\">LoRA 原理与实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）是一种参数高效微调方法，其核心思想是将模型权重更新分解为两个低秩矩阵的乘积。预训练权重保持冻结，只训练注入的低秩适配器，从而将可训练参数量降低到全量微调的 0.1-1%，同时保持接近全量微调的效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[输入 x] --&gt; B[冻结权重 W]&#10;    A --&gt; C[LoRA 下投影 A]&#10;    C --&gt; D[LoRA 上投影 B]&#10;    B --&gt; E[+]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[输出 h = Wx + BAx]\">graph LR\n    A[输入 x] --&gt; B[冻结权重 W]\n    A --&gt; C[LoRA 下投影 A]\n    C --&gt; D[LoRA 上投影 B]\n    B --&gt; E[+]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[输出 h = Wx + BAx]</pre><p>LoRA 的数学表达非常简洁：对于原始权重矩阵 W ∈ R^(d×k)，LoRA 引入两个小矩阵 A ∈ R^(r×k) 和 B ∈ R^(d×r)，其中 r &lt;&lt; min(d,k)。前向传播变为 h = Wx + BAx。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>rank (r)</td>\n<td>低秩矩阵的秩</td>\n<td>8-64</td>\n<td>表达能力 vs 参数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>alpha (α)</td>\n<td>缩放因子</td>\n<td>16-128</td>\n<td>学习率缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>target_modules</td>\n<td>应用 LoRA 的层</td>\n<td>q_proj, v_proj</td>\n<td>微调范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dropout</td>\n<td>LoRA 层 dropout</td>\n<td>0-0.1</td>\n<td>正则化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实际缩放</td>\n<td>α / r</td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>更新幅度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"lora-配置与训练\">LoRA 配置与训练</h2><p>使用 HuggingFace PEFT 库配置和训练 LoRA 微调：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from peft import LoraConfig, get_peft_model, TaskType&#10;from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments, Trainer&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;lora_config = LoraConfig(&#10;    task_type=TaskType.CAUSAL_LM,&#10;    r=16,&#10;    lora_alpha=32,&#10;    lora_dropout=0.05,&#10;    target_modules=[&quot;q_proj&quot;, &quot;k_proj&quot;, &quot;v_proj&quot;, &quot;o_proj&quot;, &quot;gate_proj&quot;, &quot;up_proj&quot;, &quot;down_proj&quot;],&#10;    bias=&quot;none&quot;,&#10;    modules_to_save=None,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = get_peft_model(model, lora_config)&#10;model.print_trainable_parameters()&#10;&#10;training_args = TrainingArguments(&#10;    output_dir=&quot;./lora-output&quot;,&#10;    num_train_epochs=3,&#10;    per_device_train_batch_size=4,&#10;    gradient_accumulation_steps=4,&#10;    learning_rate=2e-4,&#10;    warmup_ratio=0.03,&#10;    lr_scheduler_type=&quot;cosine&quot;,&#10;    bf16=True,&#10;    logging_steps=10,&#10;    save_strategy=&quot;epoch&quot;,&#10;    eval_strategy=&quot;epoch&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer = Trainer(&#10;    model=model,&#10;    args=training_args,&#10;    train_dataset=tokenized_dataset,&#10;    data_collator=data_collator,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer.train()&#10;model.save_pretrained(&quot;./lora-adapter&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peft </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LoraConfig, get_peft_model, TaskType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments, Trainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lora_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LoraConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    task_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TaskType.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAUSAL_LM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    r</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lora_alpha</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lora_dropout</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_modules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"k_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gate_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"up_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"down_proj\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    modules_to_save</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_peft_model(model, lora_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.print_trainable_parameters()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TrainingArguments(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    output_dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./lora-output\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_train_epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    per_device_train_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    gradient_accumulation_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    learning_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2e-4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    warmup_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lr_scheduler_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cosine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bf16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    logging_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    save_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"epoch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"epoch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Trainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    train_dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenized_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    data_collator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data_collator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer.train()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.save_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./lora-adapter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LoRA 的学习率通常比全量微调高一个数量级（2e-4 vs 2e-5），因为只有少量参数被更新，需要更大的步长才能产生足够的模型改变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"秩与目标模块选择\">秩与目标模块选择</h2><p>rank 和 target_modules 是影响 LoRA 效果的最重要超参数。选择策略需要平衡效果和效率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LoraStrategyGuide {&#10;  scenario: string;&#10;  recommendedRank: number;&#10;  targetModules: string[];&#10;  reasoning: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const strategies: LoraStrategyGuide[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;轻度格式适配（如输出 JSON）&#39;,&#10;    recommendedRank: 8,&#10;    targetModules: [&#39;q_proj&#39;, &#39;v_proj&#39;],&#10;    reasoning: &#39;格式调整不需要深层语义变化，低秩足够&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;领域知识注入（如医疗、法律）&#39;,&#10;    recommendedRank: 32,&#10;    targetModules: [&#39;q_proj&#39;, &#39;k_proj&#39;, &#39;v_proj&#39;, &#39;o_proj&#39;],&#10;    reasoning: &#39;领域适配需要更多参数容量，注意力层全覆盖&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;风格迁移（如特定写作风格）&#39;,&#10;    recommendedRank: 16,&#10;    targetModules: [&#39;q_proj&#39;, &#39;v_proj&#39;, &#39;gate_proj&#39;, &#39;up_proj&#39;],&#10;    reasoning: &#39;风格涉及注意力模式和 FFN 层的联合调整&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    scenario: &#39;多任务适配&#39;,&#10;    recommendedRank: 64,&#10;    targetModules: [&#39;q_proj&#39;, &#39;k_proj&#39;, &#39;v_proj&#39;, &#39;o_proj&#39;, &#39;gate_proj&#39;, &#39;up_proj&#39;, &#39;down_proj&#39;],&#10;    reasoning: &#39;多任务需要最大参数容量，接近全量微调的能力&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoraStrategyGuide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scenario</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  recommendedRank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetModules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reasoning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> strategies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoraStrategyGuide</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scenario: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'轻度格式适配（如输出 JSON）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    recommendedRank: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E